@sequence id=hello title="TLS 1.3 握手"
| actor browser | 浏览器 | frontend |
| actor server | 服务器 | backend |
| phase | 握手 |
| browser | server | ClientHello |
| server | browser | ServerHello | return |
| browser | server | GET / | emphasis |

